@startuml 13-habit-service
title PM2 Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (habit-service) - FR-13\nOwner: Mostafa Khamis Abozead
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IHabit <<provided>> {
  +CreateHabitAsync(studentId, request): Task<ServiceResult<Habit>>
  +CompleteHabitAsync(habitId, date): Task<ServiceResult<Habit>>
  +GetHabitsAsync(studentId): Task<List<Habit>>
  +GetStreaksAsync(studentId, today): Task<List<HabitStreakResponse>>
  +LinkToGoalAsync(habitId, goalId): Task<ServiceResult<Habit>>
}

class HabitsController <<component>> {
  -habitService: IHabit
  --
  +CreateHabit(request)
  +CompleteHabit(habitId, request)
  +GetHabits(studentId)
  +GetStreaks(studentId)
  +LinkToGoal(habitId, request)
}

class HabitService <<component>> {
  -repository: IHabitRepository
  --
  +CreateHabitAsync(...)
  +CompleteHabitAsync(...)
  +GetHabitsAsync(...) / GetStreaksAsync(...)
  +LinkToGoalAsync(...)
  -CalculateStreak(habit, asOfDate, logs): int
}

interface IHabitRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +GetHabitAsync(habitId): Task<Habit?>
  +GetHabitsByStudentAsync(studentId): Task<List<Habit>>
  +GetLogAsync(habitId, date): Task<HabitLog?>
  +GetLogsAsync(habitId): Task<List<HabitLog>>
  +AddHabitAsync(habit): Task
  +AddLogAsync(log): Task
  +SaveChangesAsync(): Task
}

class HabitRepository <<component>> {
  -context: HabitDbContext
  --
  +GetHabitAsync(...) / GetHabitsByStudentAsync(...)
  +GetLogAsync(...) / GetLogsAsync(...)
  +AddHabitAsync(...) / AddLogAsync(...)
  +SaveChangesAsync()
}

class HabitDbContext {
  +Habits: DbSet<Habit>
  +HabitLogs: DbSet<HabitLog>
}

class Habit {
  +HabitId: string
  +StudentId: string
  +GoalId: string?
  +Name: string
  +Frequency: HabitFrequency
  +GoalTarget: string?
  +ReminderTime: TimeOnly?
  +CurrentStreak: int
  +IsActive: bool
  +CreatedAt: DateTime
  +UpdatedAt: DateTime
  +HabitLogs: ICollection<HabitLog>
}
class HabitLog {
  +LogId: string
  +HabitId: string
  +LogDate: DateOnly
  +Completed: bool
  +CompletedAt: DateTime?
}
enum HabitFrequency {
  Daily
  Weekly
}

HabitsController --> IHabit
IHabit <|.. HabitService
HabitService --> IHabitRepository
HabitService --> Habit
HabitService --> HabitLog
IHabitRepository "1" -- "0..*" Habit : stores
IHabitRepository "1" -- "0..*" HabitLog : stores
HabitRepository ..|> IHabitRepository
HabitRepository --> HabitDbContext
HabitDbContext --> Habit
HabitDbContext --> HabitLog
Habit *-- "0..*" HabitLog
Habit --> HabitFrequency
note bottom of HabitService
SOLID applied:
S - HabitService owns streak rules; HabitRepository persists; HabitDbContext maps.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing HabitService.
L - HabitService can replace any other IHabit implementation.
I - IHabit exposes only the operations its clients use.
D - HabitService depends on IHabitRepository, not on HabitRepository.
Same-day completion is idempotent: the existing HabitLog is reused, not duplicated.
end note
@enduml
